  #line-at(78pt, 385.8pt, "circular economy models [8]. Ju et al. [9] analysed 40 types of agro-industrial biomass in ")
  #line-at(78pt, 406.56pt, "South Korea using principal component and cluster analysis, identifying biomass groups ")
  #line-at(78pt, 427.2pt, "with similar combustion characteristics and demonstrating that strategic combinations can ")
  #line-at(78pt, 447.96pt, "enhance fuel performance. ")
  #line-at(78pt, 482.64pt, "The thermochemical properties of fuels, including moisture, ash, volatile content, and ")
  #line-at(78pt, 503.28pt, "elemental composition (C, H, O, N), have been shown to significantly affect combustion ")
