  #line-at(78pt, 724.32pt, "agricultural by-products for pyrolysis and aromatic bio-oil production. As highlighted by ")
  #line-at(78pt, 744.96pt, "Jaiswal et al. [19] and Samberger [20], the integration of thermochemical processes with ")
